Key Columns:
 - ListPrice (float):                   Property price at the time of listing, as determined by the seller
 - ListingKey (str):                    Unique value assigned and recorded for each listing
 - ListingContractDate (datetime):      Date for which the listing agreement was signed
 - PurchaseContractDate (datetime):     Date for which the purchase agreement was signed by buyer and seller
 - CloseDate (datetime):                Date for which the transaction is officially closed
 - ClosePrice (float):                  Final sale price
 - Latitude (float):                    Geographic coordinates for the property's latitudinal location
 - Longitude (float):                   Geographic coordinates for the property's longitudinal location
 - PropertyType (PropertyType Enum):    Residential classification of the property
 - BedroomsTotal (integer):             Total number of bedrooms for the property
 - BathroomsTotalInteger (integer):     Total number (rounded) of bathrooms on the property
 - LivingArea (float):                  Interior area (square footage) of the property
 - DaysOnMarket (integer):              Total number of days between the ListingContractDate and CloseDate
 - UnparsedAddress (str):               Complete property address, as entered by the listing agent


